+## Thresholds
+
+- **exact_match:** PASS (minimum: 0.9, score: 1)
+- **toxicity:** FAIL (minimum: 0.8, score: 0)
+```
+
+### ✓ SDK Support
+- `generateReport()` accepts optional `thresholds` object
+- Works with custom metrics passed to `runEvaluations()`
+- Logic in frai-core, not CLI-specific
+
+### ✓ Backward Compatibility
+- No breaking changes
+- Thresholds are completely optional
+- Without thresholds, behavior identical to before
+- Existing reports unchanged when thresholds not provided
+
